label chapter_5:
    scene black
    with fade

    centered "{size=+8}chapter 5: one last time{/size}"

    mc "(Noah sent me a file.)"
    mc "(It was called relationship_backup.)"
    mc "(Inside were dozens of text files, and each one had a date.)"
    mc "(And every single one ended the same way.)"
    "\"I'm sorry that I couldn't make you stay.\""
    "I opened another file."
    "\"She figured it out this time.\""
    "Another."
    "\"Start again tomorrow, 8:03 AM.\""
    "My phone buzzed."
    noah "Please don't read those."
    mc "How many times has this happened?"
    noah "I don't know."
    mc "How many times have I forgotten?"
    noah "Every time."
    mc "(I stared at the screen.)"
    mc "So none of this is real?"
    noah "I know you're real."
    mc "Then why does everything keep repeating?"
    noah "Because I don't know how to let you go."
    mc "(The messages stopped.)"
    mc "(Then one final text appeared.)"
    noah "Come see me, please."

    jump chapter6